SatisfyingExactly, matching .github/instructions/java-tests.instructions.md:140-159 and AbstractChatTest.java:935. It expects gen_ai.request.stream=true only for CHAT_STREAM, and gen_ai.response.id=chat-1 plus gen_ai.response.model=test-model only after a response chunk; null expectations assert absence otherwise. GenAiAttributesExtractor.java:86-88 and StreamListener.java:55-104 establish those expectations. All 63 ServiceErrorTest cases pass in both the default and exception-signal-logs executions.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"inline:4329238157"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"a5b3ee57414e15fb658e8520a9ccf97eae9c28559fae7713d028385a76434519","schema":2},"download_sha256":"f3cef0c2ba97bb90e653979dc2d1ebf004e961b1dc9270226c5395c9af81736a","frozen_sha":"fb9b5351b76eff649d36e575b6faf7ad13d9a6ea","pr":20780,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"a5b3ee57414e15fb658e8520a9ccf97eae9c28559fae7713d028385a76434519","request_id":"43396b2452a94b209c54be2810209dd8","run_attempt":1,"run_id":39485029239,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:f3cef0c2ba97bb90e653979dc2d1ebf004e961b1dc9270226c5395c9af81736a","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":39488274906},"workflow_revision":"702f9d0316fccd229b4e90e9a01723d297e91b81"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5590397209],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe2 Approval recommended\n\nNo blocking defects were identified; the remaining feedback is a nonblocking test-assertion improvement.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open issue</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Strengthen assertion for span attributes and response metadata](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20780#discussion_r4329238157) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nImproves OpenAI chat and embeddings error classification in spans and operation-duration metrics.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Uses allowlisted service codes while preserving exception-class fallback.\n- Adds sync, async, and streaming error tests.\n- Documents classification behavior.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bopenai-java-1.1/\u200blibrary/\u200bsrc/\u200btest/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bv1_1/\u200bServiceErrorTest.java | Tests service-code classification and fallback telemetry. |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bopenai-java-1.1/\u200blibrary/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bv1_1/\u200bOpenAiErrorType.java | Adds shared service-code classification. |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bopenai-java-1.1/\u200blibrary/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bv1_1/\u200bEmbeddingAttributesGetter.java | Applies classification to embeddings. |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bopenai-java-1.1/\u200blibrary/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bv1_1/\u200bChatAttributesGetter.java | Applies classification to chat. |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bopenai/\u200bopenai-java-1.1/\u200blibrary/\u200bREADME.md | Documents supported codes and fallback behavior. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5590397209","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5590397209},{"body":"[Testing] This subset assertion accepts unexpected span attributes and does not check the streaming flag or partial-response ID/model. Use `hasAttributesSatisfyingExactly(...)` with those conditional attributes, as required by the test guidelines and used in `AbstractChatTest.java:935`. This is a nonblocking test-assertion improvement.","comment_commit_id":"fb9b5351b76eff649d36e575b6faf7ad13d9a6ea","comment_id":4329238157,"key":"inline:4329238157","kind":"inline","line":241,"original_commit_id":"fb9b5351b76eff649d36e575b6faf7ad13d9a6ea","original_line":241,"path":"instrumentation/openai/openai-java-1.1/library/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/openai/v1_1/ServiceErrorTest.java","review_commit_id":"fb9b5351b76eff649d36e575b6faf7ad13d9a6ea","review_id":5590397209,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-20T19:19:24Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"206951bb306d69a3d83b4656185551385caa7fd2fdf7b6f586c874a858333bf3","id":4329238157,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-20T19:19:24Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86ufFC7"}],"frozen_at":1792525018,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-20T19:36:58Z","frozen_sha":"fb9b5351b76eff649d36e575b6faf7ad13d9a6ea","head_ref":"copilot/openai-error-type-overrides","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39484938733},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nUse structured OpenAI service codes for `error.type` on chat and embeddings spans and operation-duration metrics\u2014for example, `context_length_exceeded` instead of `com.openai.errors.BadRequestException`.\n\n- **Classification:** Allowlist known codes to bound cardinality. Retain exception-class fallback for transport failures and missing, blank, malformed, or unrecognized codes; never classify from messages.\n- **Scope:** Cover sync/async calls, streaming request failures, and existing async SSE terminal callbacks. Leave lifecycle, status, and cancellation policies unchanged; exclude Responses API errors and blocking SSE iteration failures.","title":"Classify OpenAI chat and embeddings errors by service code"},"mode":"publish","pr":20780,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792525020,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"c67862a20b664d4ca4a0bb28cc2387c6","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"43396b2452a94b209c54be2810209dd8","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/702f9d0316fccd229b4e90e9a01723d297e91b81","workflow_revision":"702f9d0316fccd229b4e90e9a01723d297e91b81"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":39485029239,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/39485029239"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["cff22534e7771fc0298b912bfd4c1e064e2428bf14c31f408b5b0103dc3f8f38"],"seen_inline_findings":["ab8c55cd0ce38cf48347d7dcb0e6ac94b587be38a769c0c197c973802f5b55e8"],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"thread_effects","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":39488274906}}